The '''Salt Cube''' is an {{Uncommon}} [[Reforge Stone]] that applies the {{Ref|Salty}} [[Reforge]] to a [[Fishing Rod]], which grants {{stat|scc}}.

== Obtaining ==
The '''Salt Cube''' can be purchased from {{NPCSprite|Terry}} for {{Item|Hunk of Ice|amount=64}}.

==Usage==
===Reforging===
'''Salt Cube''' can be applied to [[Fishing Rods]] using an [[Anvil]] or [[The Hex]] to apply the {{Reforge|Salty}} reforge, to grant {{Stat|scc}}, which scales with the Fishing Rod's rarity. This has no {{skill|mining}} requirement.

Additionally, it grants the '''{{blue|Salty Bonus}}''', which doubles the stats of the reforge on {{zone|Jerry's Workshop}}. 

